OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be mainly dry. The rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be mainly dry although some
OL,8,Fpatchy rain will spread east for a
OL,9,Ftime. Freshening southwesterly wind.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FMainly dry and cloudy with a
OL,12,Flittle patchy rain at times, this
OL,13,Fmainly across the west. Best of any
OL,14,Fbrightness across eastern
OL,15,FAberdeenshire. Brisk southwesterly
OL,16,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
