OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry on Saturday although some
OL,7,Foccasional rain possible across the
OL,8,Fwest at times. Patchy rain at first on
OL,9,FSunday, otherwise dry. Dry on Monday.
